  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sokratis12GR/ArmorPlus/1.9.4/headerimg.jpg\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 橫幅標誌\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"armorplus-is-a-mod-which-introduces-brand-new-multi-tiered-arsenal-to-your-minecraft-world-each-with-its-own-unique-abilities-so-that-they-can-all-be-utilized-to-the-fullest-depending-on-the-different-situations-your-journeys-may-encounter\"><strong>ArmorPlus 是一款為你的 Minecraft 世界引入全新多層級裝備庫的模組，每套裝備都擁有獨特能力，讓它們能根據你在旅程中可能遇到的不同情況，發揮最大效用。</strong></h4>\n<h4 id=\"it-also-adds-some-world-generation-to-ensure-that-you-will-always-have-something-new-to-explore\"><strong>它還加入了一些世界生成內容，確保你總有新的東西可以探索。</strong></h4>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://nodecraft.com/r/armorplus\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/about/branding/logo-on-white-download.png\" alt=\"Nodecraft 贊助商\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" /></a></p>\n<h5 id=\"this-project-is-sponsored-by-nodecraft-use-code-armorplus-for-30-off-your-first-month-of-service\"><strong>本專案由 Nodecraft 贊助。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"https://nodecraft.com/r/armorplus\"><strong>ArmorPlus</strong></a>&nbsp;即可享有首月服務 30% 折扣！</strong></h5>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"dependencies\"><strong>依賴項目</strong></h3>\n<h4 id=\"118x-thedragonlib--geckolib-30\"><strong>1.19.x:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thedragonlib/files\">TheDragonLib</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\">GeckoLib 3.0</a></strong></h4>\n<h4 id=\"118x-thedragonlib--geckolib-30\"><strong>1.18.x:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thedragonlib/files\">TheDragonLib</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\">GeckoLib 3.0</a></strong></h4>\n<h4 id=\"116x-thedragonlib--geckolib-30\"><strong>1.16.x: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thedragonlib/files\">TheDragonLib</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\">GeckoLib 3.0</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">(即將停止支援)</span></strong></h4>\n<h4 id=\"112x-thedragonlib\"><strong>1.12.x: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thedragonlib/files\">TheDragonLib</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">(已停止支援)</span></strong></h4>\n<h4 id=\"111x-thedragonlib--forgelin\"><strong>1.11.x: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thedragonlib/files\">TheDragonLib</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shadowfacts-forgelin\">Forgelin</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">(已停止支援)</span></strong></h4>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"in-game-item--block-showcase\"><strong>遊戲內物品與方塊展示</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AzDxERr.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 熔岩與寒冰水晶方塊及礦石\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TAEqXrt.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 煤炭裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/smkpqDk.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 紅石裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e3aExgi.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 青金石裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTfOu08.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 綠寶石裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3CqMmqM.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 強化黑曜石裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6aeq9Tg.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 灌注熔岩裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8tM7Y8Q.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 守護者裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jIPbeNj.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 超級之星裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ykkl9lg.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 終界龍裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YvJbbRu.png\" alt=\"ArmorPlus 屠龍者裝備與物品\" width=\"1080\" /></p>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"video-showcasespotlights\"><strong>影片展示/重點介紹</strong></h3>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mw5qJg-FQ6s\" height=\"500\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></p>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"screenshots-of-items-via-jei\"><strong>物品截圖 (透過 JEI)</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>1.18.2</strong></h4>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQ2QLAs1j6M\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\n<h4 id=\"1102\"><strong>1.10.2</strong></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/a26492549a2b001c352ede5ce06c8e0a.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"modpacks\"><strong>模組包</strong></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/project-ozone-3-a-new-way-forward\"><strong>收錄於 Project Ozone 3</strong></a></h3>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"mod-integrations\"><strong>模組整合</strong></h3>\n<h5 id=\"armorplus-has-added-integration-with\"><strong>ArmorPlus 已加入與以下模組的整合：</strong></h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/jei\"><strong>JEI (Just Enough Items)</strong></a>: 工作台、高科技工作台、終極科技工作台與冠軍工作台&nbsp;<strong>(不支援 1.16.5+)</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-one-probe\"><strong>TOP (The One Probe)</strong></a>: 支援所有 ArmorPlus 頭盔&nbsp;<strong>(不支援 1.16.5+)</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tesla\"><strong>Tesla</strong></a>: Tesla 工具與鋼鐵盔甲 <strong>(不支援 1.12.2+)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>RF (內建)</strong>: RF 工具與鋼鐵盔甲 <strong>(不支援 1.11.2+)</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tinkers-construct\"><strong>Tinkers' Construct</strong></a>: 一些材料與修改器，例如熔岩水晶 (材料)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/projecte\"><strong>ProjectE (EMC)</strong></a>: 可配置選項，使模組中幾乎所有物品都擁有 EMC 值 (透過 armorplus/integrations.cfg 啟用)&nbsp;<strong>(不支援 1.16.5+)</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/crafttweaker\"><strong>CraftTweaker</strong></a>: 所有工作台與熔岩灌注器都支援 CT&nbsp;<strong>(不支援 1.16.5+)</strong></p>\n<h6 id=\"how-to-use-the-crafttweaker-integration\"><strong>如何使用 CraftTweaker 整合</strong></h6>\n<p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/sokratis12GR/4a56e48af0d49b5d832fb22ebc8ce56b\"><strong>點擊此處查看詳細說明</strong></a></p>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"faq\"><strong>常見問題：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>問：我發現了一個錯誤/故障/問題，我該怎麼做？</strong></p>\n<p>答：請在此處的問題追蹤器回報：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/sokratis12GR/ArmorPlus\">https://github.com/sokratis12GR/ArmorPlus</a></p>\n<p><strong>問：我想捐款支持你們的開發，該如何進行？</strong></p>\n<p>答：你可以透過此頁面捐款支持我們：<a href=\"http://paypal.me/sokratis12GR\">http://paypal.me/sokratis12GR</a> (PayPal.me)</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將此模組轉發到其他網站嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>答：不行，你不被允許將此模組的任何版本轉發到其他網站。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我是否可以使用此模組的材質或任何藝術作品？</strong></p>\n<p>答：不行。</p>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h4 id=\"modpack-permissions-link-to-them\"><strong>模組包權限 (<a href=\"https://github.com/sokratis12GR/ArmorPlus/blob/1.16.5/ModPack%20Licence.md\">連結</a>)</strong></h4>\n<h3>─────────────────────────</h3>\n<h3 id=\"want-to-support-us\"><strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>你可以透過多種方式支持我們，包括捐款或成為 Patreon 贊助者。</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/sokratis12GR\"><img src=\"https://s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/widget-images/become-patron-widget-medium%402x.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></p>\n<h3 id=\"social-links\"><strong>社群連結</strong></h3>\n<h5 id=\"twitter\"><strong>Twitter</strong></h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sokratis12GR\"><strong>在 Twitter 上追蹤我們 @sokratis12GR</strong></a></p>\n<h5 id=\"discord\"><strong>Discord</strong></h5>\n<p><a title=\"ArmorPlus 社群伺服器\" href=\"https://discord.gg/JCWbJvA\"><strong>加入我們的 ArmorPlus Discord 社群伺服器，連結：https://discord.gg/JCWbJvA</strong></a></p>",
